1
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:41,539
In cold-blooded murders,

2
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:44,240
women are rarely suspected as killers.

3
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,840
They question their physical strength,

4
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,440
and even their intelligence,

5
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:49,240
believing they can't match men.

6
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,720
But often,

7
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:52,680
they are more dangerous

8
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:55,300
and powerful than we imagine.

9
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:03,160
Everyone thought Mala died by jumping into the sea.

10
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:07,120
Only I know that wasn't his real cause of death.

11
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:10,280
We crossed Silver Lake together,

12
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:10,840
Stop talking.

13
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:11,400
Let him speak.

14
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:14,400
waiting for the comet that comes every two years to streak across the night sky.

15
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,120
It was me

16
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:16,840
who killed him.

17
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:17,800
Zhiwei.

18
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:20,000
I just think this last chapter is really good.

19
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,360
Why did we delete it?

20
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:23,490
Doesn't this make it more mysterious?

21
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:24,520
No.

22
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,890
I grabbed the wrong one.

23
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:28,180
This is the original manuscript.

24
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,360
'Confession Log'.

25
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:31,850
What does this mean?

26
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:35,280
The content of 'The Death of Mala' is almost realistic.

27
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:37,480
Mala didn't die by jumping into the sea.

28
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:40,040
Mala didn't die by jumping into the sea.

29
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:43,020
Xiaotao, this is just one of the endings.

30
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:44,720
Don't take it seriously.

31
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,440
Tell me,

32
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,520
did you really kill Mala?

33
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,840
Did you really kill Mala?

34
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,240
Tell me.

35
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,700
How did Mala actually die?

36
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:01,080
Do you know?

37
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:03,200
For the past ten years,

38
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:06,000
I've lived in repentance every single day.

39
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:10,400
I often have the same nightmare.

40
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:14,280
I always thought I was the one who killed Mala.

41
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,600
It was you who let bygones be bygones.

42
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:18,360
It was you who kept my secret for so many years.

43
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:20,480
Li Zhiwei.

44
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:25,160
I've always considered you my best brother.

45
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,200
You're only two months older than me.

46
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:30,329
I've called you brother for ten years.

47
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:33,040
I can give up the woman I like for you.

48
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:36,160
I can even give you the novel I wrote.

49
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:37,680
I gave my opportunities to you.

50
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:39,720
I gave my success to you too.

51
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:44,340
I'm just asking you one thing now.

52
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:51,040
Did Mala die by jumping into the sea?

53
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,400
Did I kill Mala?

54
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,360
No.

55
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,080
Why?

56
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:05,840
Xiaotao.

57
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:10,440
Brilliant, brilliant, brilliant.

58
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:12,040
This is the biggest twist.

59
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:14,650
This can be written into the novel.

60
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:16,760
The author killed someone.

61
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:19,480
And then wrote it into a novel.

62
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:24,100
I must write this down.

63
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,930
I must put it in the book.

64
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:27,640
Have you said enough?

65
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,880
I have all your dirt.

66
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,560
You killed Mala.

67
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:35,400
You plagiarized your brother's manuscript.

68
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:37,530
And you still want to get money from me.

69
00:04:38,159 --> 00:04:40,040
I gave you your success.

70
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:43,640
If I'm happy,

71
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:47,400
I have the power to lift you to heaven.

72
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:51,760
But if I don't want to,

73
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:57,200
I can drag you down to hell just as easily.

74
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:59,280
I'm already in hell.

75
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,880
I never expected you to pull me out.

76
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,960
What are you doing?

77
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:09,480
Forget the copyright.

78
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,760
Forget the Xinghe Award.

79
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:14,400
I don't want anything anymore.

80
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:17,130
Then no one can threaten or control me ever again.

81
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:29,760
Why are you here again?

82
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:31,120
I... I saw a ghost.

83
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:31,720
I saw a ghost.

84
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,560
Mr. Dai, what happened to your face?

85
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,400
Don't come closer.

86
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:35,280
I'm sorry.

87
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:36,440
Please don't hit me anymore.

88
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:37,440
I... I'll leave right now.

89
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:38,120
When did I hit you?

90
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,640
I'll leave right now.

91
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:41,280
Was it the guy wearing a helmet?

92
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:41,760
Li Zhiwei.

93
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:42,240
I'll get lost. I'll get lost.

94
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,480
Where did you see him?

95
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,760
Uncle Dai.

96
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,040
Mr. Dai.

97
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:06,680
If I lock this knife in the safe,

98
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,690
Sophie won't find it under the pillow.

99
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:12,680
Then I won't accidentally cut her face.

100
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:14,320
She won't go crazy,

101
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:16,780
and force me into the bathroom to loop again.

102
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:24,660
Sophie.

103
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:41,450
If my death can earn your forgiveness,

104
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:46,540
then let's wait until twelve o'clock together.

105
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,620
Do not be deceived.

106
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,720
God cannot be mocked.

107
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:36,930
Whatever a man sows,

108
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,360
that he will also reap.

109
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,120
I mean no harm.

110
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,540
Don't go. Listen to me.

111
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:56,370
Listen to me.

112
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:08,760
Come out. Listen to me.

113
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:12,050
You absolutely cannot fall into the time loop again.

114
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,320
Help!

115
00:08:19,080 --> 00:08:19,800
Let me go!
